  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Ri1IxW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"577\" height=\"319\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>添加了波霸奶茶和咖啡等饮品，它们可以使用 Create 模组中的机器进行制作。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">超过 40 种口味可供自动化生产！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ltNTbl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"603\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M2UUrec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"237\"></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AWuqkC9Xmx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/006/892/625/original/discord-logo-icon-editorial-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Discord Logo Icon editorial vector 6892625 Vector Art at Vecteezy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/dev_myst\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/002/534/045/original/social-media-twitter-logo-blue-isolated-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Twitter Bird Icon Vector Art, Icons, and Graphics for Free Download\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">获取更多口味：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pams Harvestcraft 2 Trees</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Crops</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan </a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他推荐的食物模组：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seasonals（需要 Atmospheric 和 Autumnity）</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Peculiars（需要 Atmospheric）</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Food Core</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-extended\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Extended（需要 Pam's Trees 和 Crops）</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">如有建议或问题，请前往 Github 上的 Issues 页面。</span></strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">您可以在本页面第 4 个标签页 \"Issues\" 中找到它。</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：不支持 1.16 版本，且可能不会收到许多更新。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
